title │ ␛]0;title from YAML escapes␇
raw   │ a raw ESC ␛ in a value

# Control characters, ESC [1m: ␛[1m

Every line of this document ends with CRLF. Each control character below is
written as the raw byte, right after its name.

A color sequence, ESC [31m and ESC [0m: ␛[31mred␛[0m. A window title sequence,
ESC ]0; and BEL: ␛]0;pwned␇. DEL: ␡. The C1 control U+009B: �. The invalid byte
0xFF: �.

Character references &#27;, &#7; and &#x9b;: ␛[31m, ␇, �.

This paragraph has a lone CR here: the text goes on after it.

## Table

Bytes │ Cell
──────┼─────
ESC   │ a␛b
BEL   │ a␇b
&#27; │ a␛b

## Links and images

A link with a title sequence, ESC and BEL, in the destination
(https://example.com/␛]0;pwned␇)

[image: An image with ESC in the alt text: ␛] (image.png)

